        Review of Hallucination Understanding in Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> and Vision <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ho%2C+Z">Zhengyi Ho</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liang%2C+S">Siyuan Liang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tao%2C+D">Dacheng Tao</a>
      
