    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Explanation-Driven Counterfactual Testing for Faithfulness in Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Explanations
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ding%2C+S">Sihao Ding</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Vasa%2C+S">Santosh Vasa</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ramadwar%2C+A">Aditi Ramadwar</a>
      
