        BigBang-Proton Technical Report: Next-Word-Prediction is Scientific Multitask Learner
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+H">Hengkui Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+L">Liujiang Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+J">Jihua He</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Q">Qihao Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+K">Keke Zhao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hu%2C+S">Shuyang Hu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fu%2C+R">Renle Fu</a>, 
      
